# Optional public demo/support setting. Leave unset for operational deployments.
# Standalone operational AssetTrack does not require /demo or demo tokens.
# Demo tokens only unlock sample receipt sending from /demo.
# They do not authenticate users or grant operational access.
# Preferred format: LABEL.YYYYMMDD.EXPdays
# ASSETTRACK_DEMO_TOKENS=TEAM-A.YYYYMMDD.EXP7
